    S:gt.blockmachines.multimachine.em.forge_of_gods.tooltip=Machine Type: §eStellar Forge§r\n§7§oAlso known as Godforge or Gorge for short\n§7§b§m-------------------------------------------------------------------------\n§7A massive structure harnessing the thermal, gravitational and\n§7kinetic energy of a stabilised neutron star for material processing\n§7This multiblock can house §cup to 16 modules §7which utilize the star to energize materials\n§7to varying degrees, ranging from regular smelting to matter degeneration\n§7EU requirements for all modules are handled via wireless energy directly\n§7§b§m-------------------------------------------------------------------------\n§7This multiblock has an §6extensive upgrade tree §7which influences all of its functions,\n§7such as §6unlocking new module types§7, §6increasing heat levels §7and §6granting\n§7§6various processing speed bonuses§7. These upgrades can be unlocked by reaching\n§7certain milestones and/or spending materials\n§7§b§m-------------------------------------------------------------------------\n§7§aClicking on the logo in the controller gui opens an extensive information window§7,\n§7explaining everything there is to know about this multiblock\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nHold §l[LSHIFT]§r§7 to display structure guidelines
