    S:gt.blockmachines.multimachine.endothermichfridge.tooltip=Machine Type: §eVacuum Freezer, EnF, MVF§r\n§6256§7 Parallels\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nWhile active, the machine will cool down and increase its speed bonus up to §a1.5x\nTakes §d5 minutes§7 of constant running to reach maximum bonus\nWhile not running, the machine will return to normal temperatures\nOptionally supply §3250 L§7/s of §bCryotheum§7 to speed up cooling by §95x\nThe drain rate of §bCryotheum§7 will increase §dlinearly§7 with the speed modifier\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nUpgrade to §dTier 2§7 to unlock §3Subspace Cooling\nWill apply §aperfect overclocks §7by §6consuming §dexotic coolants:\n§620 L/s§7 : §a1 §7: §dMolten Infinity\n§620 L/s§7 : §a2 §7: §dMolten Spacetime\n§620 L/s§7 : §a3 §7: §dMolten Eternity\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\n§aSupports Multi-Amp and Laser Hatches!\nThis machine can run recipes regardless of tier, if given enough energy\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\n§o§b... without the other!\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nHold §l[LSHIFT]§r§7 to display structure guidelines\nStructure by: §aPix3lated§r§7
